WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:09.799
Nnọọ na WODDI Institute. Ntụziaka dị mkpụmkpụ a ga-egosi gị otu esi eji ngwa a, nzọụkwụ n'nzọụkwụ.

2
00:00:09.799 --> 00:00:19.822
WODDI Institute bụ mmụta n'efu maka ụmụ nwanyị n'Africa niile: nka ọrụ aka, ndị ndụmọdụ na asambodo, na ekwentị gị.

3
00:00:20.372 --> 00:00:28.238
Nke mbụ, họrọ asụsụ gị. Pịa ya n'elu ibe ahụ. Ngwa ahụ ga-agbanwe gaa n'asụsụ gị.

4
00:00:28.788 --> 00:00:32.686
Iji debanye aha, pịa bọtịnụ mmalite.

5
00:00:32.686 --> 00:00:34.986
Dee aha gị zuru ezu.

6
00:00:34.986 --> 00:00:42.899
Ị nwere ike iji email gị ma ọ bụ nọmba ekwentị gị debanye aha. N'ebe a, anyị na-eji nọmba ekwentị.

7
00:00:42.899 --> 00:00:46.218
Họrọ obodo gị, wee họrọ otu gị.

8
00:00:46.218 --> 00:00:53.364
Mee okwuntughe nwere mkpụrụedemede ma ọ bụ nọmba isii ma ọ dịkarịa ala, wee pịa Mepụta akaụntụ.

9
00:00:53.364 --> 00:00:58.784
Akaụntụ gị adịla njikere. Pịa bọtịnụ ahụ iji mepee ibe gị.

10
00:00:59.334 --> 00:01:01.867
Oge ọzọ, pịa Banye.

11
00:01:01.867 --> 00:01:10.130
Tinye otu nọmba ekwentị ma ọ bụ email ahụ, na okwuntughe gị. Ị nwekwara ike ịpị Gaa n'ihu na Google.

12
00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:17.334
Ọ bụrụ na i chefuo okwuntughe gị, pịa Echefuru m okwuntughe, anyị ga-enyere gị aka.

13
00:01:17.884 --> 00:01:24.447
Nke a bụ ibe mbụ gị. Kaadị buru ibu ahụ na-egosi nzọụkwụ gị ọzọ mgbe niile.

14
00:01:24.447 --> 00:01:34.214
Menu dị n'okpuru na-akpọga gị ebe niile: ụlọ, mmụta, obodo, onye ndụmọdụ, profaịlụ gị na ndị ọzọ.

15
00:01:34.764 --> 00:01:45.120
Onye ọ bụla na-amalite na Rooting, ọkwa mgbọrọgwụ: modul asatọ dị mkpụmkpụ gbasara WODDI na njem gị. Pịa bọtịnụ mmalite.

16
00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:47.170
Mepee modul nke mbụ.

17
00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:50.256
Gụọ ihe ọmụmụ ahụ ruo na njedebe.

18
00:01:50.256 --> 00:01:58.783
Zaa ajụjụ nta ahụ, wee pịa Zipu ma mechaa. Modul na-esote ga-emepe. Mechaa ha asatọ.

19
00:01:59.333 --> 00:02:06.227
Mgbe ị mechara Rooting, Blueprint ga-emepe. Pịa kaadị Blueprint.

20
00:02:06.227 --> 00:02:17.295
Blueprint nwere ogidi atọ: Njirimara, Ozi ọrụ, na Mmetụta na Ihe nketa. Mechaa ha n'usoro, n'otu ụzọ ahụ.

21
00:02:17.845 --> 00:02:27.288
Mgbe Blueprint gasịrị, Ebe Ọmụmụ ga-emepe, nwere ihe karịrị otu narị ọmụmụ. Pịa akara mmụta n'okpuru.

22
00:02:27.288 --> 00:02:31.163
Pịa Lelee ọmụmụ, wee họrọ ọmụmụ masịrị gị.

23
00:02:31.163 --> 00:02:36.110
Ibe ọmụmụ ahụ na-egosi ihe ị ga-amụta. Pịa Malite ọmụmụ.

24
00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:41.473
Gụọ ihe ọmụmụ ọ bụla, ma ọ bụ pịa bọtịnụ ekweisi iji gee ya ntị.

25
00:02:41.473 --> 00:02:50.534
Pịa Gaa n'ihu iji gaa n'ihu. Modul ọ bụla na-ejedebe na obere ule, ọmụmụ ahụ na-ejedebekwa na ule ikpeazụ.

26
00:02:51.084 --> 00:02:58.600
Mgbe ị gafere ule ikpeazụ, ị ga-enweta asambodo. Iji hụ ya, pịa Ndị ọzọ.

27
00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:00.338
Wee pịa Asambodo.

28
00:03:00.338 --> 00:03:02.384
Pịa Lee ma budata.

29
00:03:02.384 --> 00:03:11.807
Pịa Budata PDF, ma ọ bụ PNG maka foto. Onye ọ bụla nwere ike ịlele asambodo gị n'ịntanetị site na koodu ya.

30
00:03:12.357 --> 00:03:20.717
Asambodo gị na-emepekwa ebe ndị gụsịrị akwụkwọ. Na ibe mbụ, pịa Obodo ndị gụsịrị akwụkwọ.

31
00:03:20.717 --> 00:03:29.526
Kekọrịta ihe ịga nke ọma, jụọ ajụjụ ma ọ bụ nye aka. Dee ozi gị wee pịa Biputa.

32
00:03:29.526 --> 00:03:37.610
N'ebe a, ị nwekwara ike isonye n'otu, zute ndị ọzọ gụsịrị akwụkwọ, ma chọta ohere na mmemme.

33
00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:43.086
Iji ree ngwaahịa ma ọ bụ nka, pịa Ụlọ ahịa m na Marketplace.

34
00:03:43.086 --> 00:03:48.714
Pịa Mgbasa ozi ọhụrụ, wee họrọ ngwaahịa, ọrụ ma ọ bụ nka.

35
00:03:48.714 --> 00:03:54.405
Nye ya aha doro anya ma họrọ ụdị.

36
00:03:54.405 --> 00:04:06.269
Kọwaa ya ma tinye ọnụahịa gị.

37
00:04:06.269 --> 00:04:13.452
Tinye nọmba WhatsApp gị wee pịa Biputa mgbasa ozi. Ndị na-azụ ga-akpọtụrụ gị ozugbo.

38
00:04:14.002 --> 00:04:18.569
Ị chọrọ enyemaka n'oge ọ bụla? Pịa Onye ndụmọdụ.

39
00:04:18.569 --> 00:04:28.029
Dee ajụjụ gị wee pịa zipu. Onye ndụmọdụ gị ga-aza n'asụsụ gị.

40
00:04:28.029 --> 00:04:31.625
Ị nwekwara ike ịpị igwe okwu wee kwuo okwu.

41
00:04:31.625 --> 00:04:36.589
Iji malite mkparịta ụka ọhụrụ, pịa Hichapụ mkparịta ụka.

42
00:04:37.139 --> 00:04:43.321
Iji gbanwee otu ngwa ahụ si arụ ọrụ, pịa Ndị ọzọ, wee pịa Ntọala.

43
00:04:43.321 --> 00:04:47.564
N'ebe a, ị nwere ike ịgbanye ma ọ bụ ịgbanyụ ọchịchịrị,

44
00:04:47.564 --> 00:04:50.451
mee ka mkpụrụedemede buo ibu,

45
00:04:50.451 --> 00:04:57.183
gbanwee asụsụ ngwa ahụ, ma gbanye ọkwa ekwentị, ka ozi ọ bụla ghara ịgafe gị.

46
00:04:57.183 --> 00:04:59.266
Pụọ dị n'okpuru ala.

47
00:04:59.816 --> 00:05:06.214
Iji lelee ntụziaka a ọzọ, pịa Ndị ọzọ, wee pịa Otu esi eji ya.

48
00:05:06.214 --> 00:05:12.505
Ị dịla njikere. Nnọọ na WODDI Institute. Ọ dịghị nwanyị a hapụrụ n'azụ.

